:"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000121390026019885/0001213900-26-019885-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-12-19","form":"8-K","codes":["1.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Material agreement entered","kind":"deal","tone":"good"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000121390025123890/0001213900-25-123890-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-12-17","form":"8-K","codes":["1.02","7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Material agreement terminated","kind":"deal","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000121390025122796/0001213900-25-122796-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-12-17","form":"8-K","codes":["1.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Material agreement entered","kind":"deal","tone":"good"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000121390025122558/0001213900-25-122558-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[{"date":"2023-06-02","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000119312523159948/0001193125-23-159948-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2023-06-02","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000121390023045829/0001213900-23-045829-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2023-06-02","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000114036123028095/0001140361-23-028095-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["TIGO ENERGY, INC. files with the SEC under \"Semiconductors & Related Devices\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $98.7m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 33.7% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 42.8%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 13 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 33.7% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $25.2m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000185544726000003/0001855447-26-000003-index.htm","accession":"0001855447-26-000003"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 38.1% to 42.8% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000185544726000003/0001855447-26-000003-index.htm","accession":"0001855447-26-000003"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 87.7% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000185544726000003/0001855447-26-000003-index.htm","accession":"0001855447-26-000003"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-9.6% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000185544726000003/0001855447-26-000003-index.htm","accession":"0001855447-26-000003"},{"text":"About 13 months of cash at the current burn ($27.4m against $26.1m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000185544726000003/0001855447-26-000003-index.htm","accession":"0001855447-26-000003"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 17.7% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000185544726000003/0001855447-26-000003-index.htm","accession":"0001855447-26-000003"},{"text":"Debt of $47.2m against equity of $40.8m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000185544726000003/0001855447-26-000003-index.htm","accession":"0001855447-26-000003"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 9.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (463,444 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855447/000121390026068987/0001213900-26-068987-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 35.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.35,"consecutive":2,"current":0.428,"current_display":"42.8%","threshold_display":"35.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 17.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.17,"consecutive":2,"current":0.337,"current_display":"33.7%","threshold_display":"17.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"runway_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Cash runway falls below 12 months","metric":"runway_months","comparison":"below","threshold":12.0,"consecutive":1,"current":12.576,"current_display":"13 months","threshold_display":"12 months","fired":false,"rationale":"Below twelve months the company raises on whatever terms it can get